    <briefdescription>
<para>Abstract base class for all scenes in the engine. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>A scene represents a distinct game state or screen (e.g., menu, gameplay, pause). Each scene must implement lifecycle methods: OnEnter, OnExit, Update, and Render.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>Scenes are managed by the <ref refid="classSceneManager" kindref="compound">SceneManager</ref>. </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classSceneManager" kindref="compound">SceneManager</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
